---
const routes = [
  ['Reading trail', 'I am following an idea and want a useful next object.'],
  ['Project conversation', 'I have a real situation, constraint, or research question.'],
  ['Collaboration or work', 'I want to discuss a possible way of working together.'],
  ['Correction', 'I want to point to a claim, source, route, or access barrier.'],
] as const;
---

<section id="intake" class="correspondence-intake" aria-labelledby="intake-title">
  <header>
    <div>
      <p class="research-eyebrow">Correspondence intake / public-safe Tally form</p>
      <h2 id="intake-title">Bring the situation, not a performance.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>A short intake gives a future conversation enough structure to begin well: its purpose, the constraint already in view, and the next useful question.</p>
      <button class="correspondence-intake__open" type="button" data-intake-open>Open the intake <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
    </div>
  </header>
  <ol>
    {routes.map(([title, description], index) => <li><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><strong>{title}</strong><p>{description}</p></li>)}
  </ol>
  <p class="correspondence-intake__boundary"><strong>Provider boundary:</strong> Tally receives submissions through this public-safe form; the Hearth &amp; Code landing site does not store them. Do not submit confidential, client, health, credential, or other sensitive material.</p>
</section>

<dialog id="correspondence-intake-dialog" class="correspondence-intake-dialog" aria-labelledby="intake-dialog-title">
  <form method="dialog" class="correspondence-intake-dialog__close-form"><button type="submit" aria-label="Close correspondence intake">×</button></form>
  <div class="correspondence-intake-dialog__sheet">
    <header>
      <p class="research-eyebrow">Hearth &amp; Code / correspondence intake</p>
      <h2 id="intake-dialog-title">What is the situation you are carrying?</h2>
      <p>Use the smallest amount of context that makes the next conversation useful. Tally receives the submission; this landing site does not store it.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="correspondence-intake-dialog__embed">
      <iframe src="https://tally.so/embed/zx9Xb8?alignLeft=1&amp;hideTitle=1&amp;dynamicHeight=1" title="Hearth &amp; Code correspondence intake" loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </div>
    <aside><strong>Direct form link</strong><p>If the embedded form does not load, <a href="https://tally.so/r/zx9Xb8" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">open the correspondence intake in Tally <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>. Tally, not this landing site, receives submissions.</p></aside>
  </div>
</dialog>

<script>
  const dialog = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>('#correspondence-intake-dialog');
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-intake-open]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (dialog && !dialog.open) dialog.showModal();
  }));
</script>
